<title>USA: Control Data offers systems in Germany.</title>
<headline>Control Data offers systems in Germany.</headline>
<dateline>ARDEN HILLS, Minn. 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Control Data Systems Inc said Monday it will jointly develop messaging systems and directory applications with Deutsche Telekom AG for the German company's Internet service, called T-Intra.</p>
<p>Several of Control Data's Rialto product line will be integrated into the multimedia services platform of Deutsche Telekom, which offers telecommunications services.</p>
<p>Financial terms of the pact were not announced.</p>
<p>Control Data is a software and services company.</p>
<p>Its shares closed off 1/4 Monday at 14-1/4.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
